scope one red closed with a witness on metal and no grade moved, three shipped pages joined the shelf's web, the shipping shelf swept to plain ASCII, and one roster red surfaced rather than locally silenced
status GREEN -- closing hot pass 140 green, 4 gated at custody, tree_moved=no. Two reds and ONE cause: sow_allow_reach wants a seed/ projection this tree has never built, and standing_equipment reds because it reads the run card and finds that red -- its own evidence prints red: sow_allow_reach beside red_self, so the roster's guard is echoing rather than adding. Surfaced on the card as not mine to close
recommend kg -- Reach carries a ceiling and no floor, so a page that leads nowhere scores 100 on the reading named can the reader follow it; the three sangha pages were exactly that shape an hour ago. Measuring how many shipped pages still lead nowhere is the next lap in this lane, and it is the half of the wiki's promise that no instrument reads.
